	(text "EV6.3.8 A red indicator light in the cockpit that is easily visible                                   \nfrom inside and outside the cockpit even in bright sunlight and                                    \nclearly marked with the lettering “IMD” must light up if and only\nif the IMD opens the SDC. It must stay illuminated until the error                                   \nstate has been manually reset, see EV6.1.6. Signals controlling                                       \nthis indicator are SCS, see T11.9."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 8.636 18.2372 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "KiCad Font")
				(size 1.8288 1.8288)
